"&6&l\"Adaptive power grid system terminal\""
"&9is the core control block of the adaptive power grid system, managing the voltage levels of the entire base’s energy warehouse with one click."
""
"&7▌ Tutorial:"
"&l1. Place the terminal of the adaptive distribution network system first"
""
"&l2. Click Permission Control in the lower left corner of the GUI. Click on the interface that displays English. The owner of the main interface will be displayed as your ID."
""
"&l3. Click Frequency Settings in the lower left corner of the GUI and adjust the frequency to 1"
""
"&lAt this point, the setting of the adaptive distribution grid system terminal is completed."
""
"&7▌ Suggestions:"
"&l&6You can also control the configuration without changing the permissions, and the power grid can be used by everyone."
]
