			description: [
"&5&l[The stars return to silence]"
""
"&d&oYou collected a hundred thousand stars and turned them into the road under your feet."
"&d&oToday, you stand in front of the sun - the heart of the universe curled up in eleven-dimensional space and time."
"&d&oThe stars are silent for you, and the sun is burning for you."
"&d&oThis minute of gazing is the most pious pilgrimage of mortal beings to eternity."
""
"&l&cCompletion conditions:"
"&8• Complete all \"&eExtra Content &8\" chapter missions"
"&8• 100000 star arrays at the same time"
"&8• Observe the Heart of the Universe for 1 minute"
""
